1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:02,240
Raka diam 10 menit di rapat.

2
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:04,300
Idenya dipakai, tapi bukan dia

3
00:00:04,340 --> 00:00:05,540
yang ngomong.

4
00:00:05,580 --> 00:00:07,880
Padahal dari jam 9 pagi,

5
00:00:07,920 --> 00:00:09,960
ide itu udah ada di kepalanya.

6
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,800
Tapi satu pikiran bikin dia

7
00:00:11,840 --> 00:00:12,940
nahan diri.

8
00:00:12,980 --> 00:00:14,700
Nanti dibilang sok tahu.

9
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:16,920
Jadi dia diam.

10
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:18,440
Sampai temannya ngomong ide

11
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:20,900
yang mirip, dan semua orang

12
00:00:20,940 --> 00:00:21,720
mengangguk.

13
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:23,880
Malamnya Raka nanya ke dirinya

14
00:00:23,920 --> 00:00:24,760
sendiri.

15
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:26,320
Aku ini rendah hati,

16
00:00:26,360 --> 00:00:28,020
atau cuma takut?

17
00:00:28,060 --> 00:00:29,500
Pelan-pelan dia paham.

18
00:00:29,540 --> 00:00:31,520
Rendah hati itu soal cara kita

19
00:00:31,560 --> 00:00:33,140
memandang orang, sedangkan

20
00:00:33,180 --> 00:00:36,120
pede soal berani menawarkan

21
00:00:36,160 --> 00:00:37,060
yang kita punya.

22
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:40,280
Dua-duanya bisa jalan bareng.

23
00:00:40,320 --> 00:00:41,300
Rapat berikutnya,

24
00:00:41,340 --> 00:00:43,160
Raka cuma butuh satu kalimat.

25
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:44,800
Aku punya satu usulan.

26
00:00:44,840 --> 00:00:46,480
Kalau kamu pernah jadi Raka,

27
00:00:46,520 --> 00:00:47,780
kamu gak sendirian.

28
00:00:47,820 --> 00:00:49,660
Follow, biar di rapat

29
00:00:49,700 --> 00:00:51,860
berikutnya, kamu yang ngomong.
